  "sn55.25:2.10": "",
  "sn55.25:3.1": "This statement is in line with a verse in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn20'>DN 20</a>: “Those who have gone to the Buddha for refuge will not go to the plane of woe. On discarding the human body, they will fill the hosts of the devas.”",
