  "sn55.25:8.8": "Aside from one detail, this individual fits the descriptions of the “Dhamma-follower” given in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn70'>MN 70</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn25.1'>SN 25:1</a>. The one detail is that <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn25.1'>SN 25:1</a> describes him/her as incapable of passing away until he/she has realized the fruit of stream-entry. Here, however, the Dhamma-follower is not said to be released from the lower realms, which would be the case with a stream-winner. Instead, he/she simply will not go to the lower realms at the end of this life.",
